Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 21:15:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Read stock live from the database (STOCK_SOURCE=db)

The inventory actions no longer depend on a hand-exported current_stock.csv:
with STOCK_SOURCE=db the service reads products.sku/products.stock with the
read-only forecast_ro user, caches it for STOCK_CACHE_SECONDS (600), and keeps
serving the last good read if a refresh fails. STOCK_SOURCE=file (default)
keeps the old snapshot behaviour.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
